  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective: Improved gender-responsive service delivery and climate justice in Karamoja through increasing women&#x2019;s participation in decision-making and strengthening accountability mechanisms by 2027

Outcome 1: Increased participation of women in decision-making processes on gender-responsive service delivery and climate justice in the Karamoja region. 

Outcome 2: Accountability mechanisms strengthened to foster effective service delivery, gender-responsive policies and climate adaptation for women and marginalized communities in Karamoja.</narrative>
  </description>
